CREATE TABLE "DrawRecord" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"categoryId" TEXT NOT NULL UNIQUE REFERENCES "Category"("id") ON DELETE RESTRICT,"version" INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 1,"status" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'PREVIEW',"fingerprint" TEXT NOT NULL,"snapshot" JSONB NOT NULL,"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,"confirmedAt" TIMESTAMP(3));
CREATE TABLE "Contest" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"drawId" TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES "DrawRecord"("id") ON DELETE RESTRICT,"key" TEXT NOT NULL,"round" INTEGER NOT NULL,"whiteEntryId" TEXT,"blueEntryId" TEXT,"status" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'WAITING',"tatamiId" TEXT REFERENCES "Tatami"("id") ON DELETE RESTRICT,"queueOrder" INTEGER, UNIQUE("drawId","key"),UNIQUE("tatamiId","queueOrder"));
CREATE TABLE "AuditEvent" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"actorId" TEXT NOT NULL,"tournamentId" TEXT NOT NULL,"action" TEXT NOT NULL,"entityId" TEXT NOT NULL,"payload" JSONB NOT NULL,"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
